OL,3,GNEWSAThe ducks so colourful they look
OL,4,Alike a 'painting'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith vibrant colours and bright orange
OL,7,Fsail feathers, mandarin ducks have
OL,8,Frecently been popping up across the
OL,9,FWest Midlands, delighting residents and
OL,10,Fleaving many wondering how such a
OL,11,Fstriking species ended up on their
OL,12,Fdoorstep.
OL,14,FThe exotic-looking birds have been
OL,15,Fattracting birdwatchers and
OL,16,Fphotographers to a number of beauty
OL,17,Fspots across the region, including
OL,18,FBirmingham's Sutton Park.
OL,20,FOne local photographer, Jamil El Farsi,
OL,21,Fsaid finding the birds so close to home
OL,22,Fwas "unbelievable".
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
