OL,3,GNEWSAThe ducks so colourful they look
OL,4,Alike a 'painting'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They don't look real, they look like a
OL,7,Fpainting," he said. "That's how vibrant
OL,8,Fthey are, the colours."
